abstract: >-
  A nine-unit Indonesian self-study reader on mathematical literature search,
  proof reconstruction, provenance, exposition, reproducible computation,
  errata, peer criticism, bounded community contribution, and a separate
  authentic-delivery and structured-assessment wrapper. The PDF is untagged;
  the offline HTML archive is the accessible edition. Software,
  factual data, donor adaptations, and bundled browser runtimes retain the
  component-specific licenses stated in LICENSES.md. Production system:
  OpenAI Codex gpt-5.6-sol, Ultra. Used under the human creator's direction.
keywords:
  - mathematics education
  - mathematical writing
  - research practice
  - reproducibility
  - proof reconstruction
  - Bahasa Indonesia
